\par\par \b \uc2  Tokyo Stocks End-2:Local Corporate Investors Lead Selling \b0\par\par\uc2 263 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 August 1999\par 09:42\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  According to Daiwa Institute of Research, 370 companies, or 30.94%, of the 1,196 companies listed on the TSE's first section generated 10% or more of their revenues from exports in the fiscal year ended March 31. \par \par \uc2  "It didn't make sense anyway that financial stocks other than those involved in the 3-bank alliance rallied this far (since Friday) on mere speculation of follow-through tie-ups," said a trader at a French brokerage firm. \par \par \uc2  "The market's focus is now back to \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates" while irrational heat on financial stocks runs out of steam, he said. \par \par \uc2  The yen's rebound midday Wednesday after weakening briefly on the rumor of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  overshadowed prospects for a halt to the yen's appreciation in the near term, said a trader at Maruwa Securities. \par \par \uc2  "Bargain-hunters all moved to the sidelines amid uncertainties over the yen's future direction," he said. \par \par \uc2  Earlier, stock market participants were bullish on sentiment that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  would carry through a concerted or single-handed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem the yen's rise. \par \par \uc2  Local corporate investors led sales, placing heavy sell orders during the midday break on export-oriented blue chips and financial stocks, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Foreign investors were net buyers, although their purchases were not as brisk as seen recently, traders at foreign brokerages said. \par \par \uc2  While taking profits on selected bank, brokerage and insurance stocks, foreign investors actively bought selected technology and bank stocks, traders said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 25-08-99 \par \par \uc2  0742GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv8p066ny\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
