eign investors actively bought selected technology and bank stocks, traders said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  25-08-99 \par \par \uc2  0742GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument aer0000020010824dv8p00jzy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
