\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  IN EUROPE-Yen leaps on asset demand,BOJ absence. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Lisa Jucca \par \uc2 558 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 August 1999\par 17:57\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, Aug 18 (Reuters) - The yen zoomed to six-month peaks against the dollar and life highs against the euro on Wednesday amid talk of mounting demand for Japanese stocks and in the absence of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The dollar slumped as far as 111.66 yen, its weakest since February 5 and down more than two percent from its overnight highs. The yen's exuberance also dragged the euro to a life low of 117.73 yen, down about 11 percent since its launch. \par \par \uc2  Hopes of economic recovery gathering momentum have triggered a two-week rally in the Japanese stock market's Nikkei average. While foreign money is being attracted as a result, analysts said Japanese capital repatriation was also playing an important role in fuelling the yen's rise. \par \par \uc2  "Expectations of a recovery in Japan is part of the story, but it is not the whole story," said David Coleman, chief economist at CIBC World Markets. \par \par \uc2  "There is a growing feeling that capital is flowing back to Japan and this should support the yen to the detriment of the U.S. dollar." \par \par \uc2  The yen's rally gathered momentum as it breached barrier after barrier without triggering \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "In the past they (BOJ) have been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  at levels higher than 120 yen, so it's surprising they've not been seen around," said Andrew Snowball, international economist at Julius Baer Investments in London. \par \par \uc2  "The lack of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  signals a definite change in tone." \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been spotted selling yen for dollars at least seven times since June 10 but has been absent from the market since July 21. \par \par \uc2  By 1525 GMT, dollar/yen was at 112.15/20 from 114.24/34 late in Europe on Tuesday. Euro/yen was at 118.03/23 from 120.11/15 in late European trading on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Earlier in the day the dollar spiked up more than a 1/4 yen amid jittery trading. Traders said they did not detect any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the BOJ but that the sharp upsurge proved there was still lingering wariness about possible \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action. \par \par \uc2  "Any sort of gesture from the BOJ could shake out a lot of peaople at this levels," said Cameron Crise, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Warburg Dillon Read in London. "I doubt they (BOJ) would be happy to see dollar/yen below 110." \par \par \uc2  Euro/dollar remained sidelined in tight ranges throughout the session, failing to clear the key $1.0550 barrier which chartists say would allow the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to resume its uptrend if breached. It was last at $1.0527/29 compared with $1.0510/14 late in Europe on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the euro could take centre stage on Thursday with the release of the eagerly-awaited July German Ifo survey, scheduled at 0800 GMT. \par \par \uc2  "There are chances of it (Ifo survey) being slightly disappointing because it jumped a lot in the previous survey," said Coleman at CIBC World Markets. \par \par \uc2  Analysts polled by Reuters expect on average the July Ifo business climate index to rise to 93.5 from 92.9 in June. The index was at 90.5 in May. \par \par \uc2  ((Lisa Jucca, London Capital Markets 0171 542 6745, elisabetta.jucca@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv8i02ese\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
