\par\par \b \uc2  Dollar Up Vs Euro On U.S. Asset Gains, But Down Vs Yen \b0\par\par\uc2  By Stephanie Hoo \par \uc2 553 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 August 1999\par 17:11\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW YORK (Dow Jones)--The slightly positive showing in U.S. assets Tuesday morning following as-expected consumer-price data is helping the dollar extend its gains against the euro, but the yen continues to trade on its own set of issues. \par \par \uc2  Against the euro, "the dollar is still following the pattern of the last few days," said Larry Hatheway, global head of strategy at Warburg Dillon Read in Stamford, Conn. "If bonds and credit markets are doing better, stocks and the dollar tends to do a little better," he said. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. Consumer Price Index rose 0.3% in June, meeting expectations and giving the Federal Reserve board its last major bit of economic information before its Aug. 24 meeting. \par \par \uc2  While caution will continue to reign until Aug. 24, Tuesday's data are likely to soothe bond investors who have worried that more aggressive price pressures would prompt stronger Fed action to slow the economy. \par \par \uc2  Investors widely expect the Fed to raise rates 25 basis points. \par \par \uc2  At mid-morning in New York, the 30-year Treasury was up 25/32 to yield 6.03% and Dow Jones industrials were up about five points. The euro was worth $1.0507, down from $1.0528 at 7:45 a.m. EDT (1145 GMT) and $1.0578 late Monday in New York. \par \par \uc2  The euro has found good support in the neighborhood of $1.0500 thus far Tuesday. But technical analysts are eying a test of the $1.0475 area, which is a 50% retracement of the euro's climb from its July 19 low around $1.0125 to its Aug. 5 high around $1.0825. \par \par \uc2  Dollar/yen, however, is another kettle of fish. Heavy selling of euros for yen continues early Tuesday, as Japanese investors bail out of loss-making positions and hedge their options positions. \par \par \uc2  The euro has traded as weak as Y119.91 Tuesday - its lowest ever - and the cross action threatens to drag the dollar back down below Y114.00 and a test of its August low of Y113.60. \par \par \uc2  At mid-morning, the dollar was worth Y114.30, down from Y114.65 late Monday. \par \par \uc2  While the yen has been strengthening steadily since Japan reported surprisingly strong first-quarter growth in June, the yen received an added boost Tuesday when Bank of Japan Governor Masaru Hayami appeared to downplay the possibility of yen-weakening \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "It's inappropriate to use \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to aim at a specific exchange rate level," Hayami said at a regular news conference. \par \par \uc2  And while Hayami acknowledged that a continued rise in the yen would hurt exporters, he added, "Japanese companies should make their businesses more resistant to \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves." \par \par \uc2  The yen rose against all major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and traders are hard-pressed to guess a bottom for euro/yen. \par \par \uc2  "Mr. Hayami basically said Japanese corporates can't rely on the government to bail them out anymore," said Jeffrey Yu, vice president at Sanwa Bank in New York. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The BOJ, acting on policy set by \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Ministry of Finance\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ,\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  seven times in June and July to stem yen strength to the tune\par of about $34 billion.\par     -By Stephanie Hoo; 201-938-4384\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 17-08-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1511GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv8h064h5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
