\par\par \b \uc2  Euro/yen slide seen raising chances of BOJ action. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Swaha Pattanaik \par \uc2 556 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 August 1999\par 12:58\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, Aug 16 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be forced to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb yen strength for the first time in nearly four weeks as the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gains against the euro threaten to spiral out of control, analysts said on Monday. \par \par \uc2  The risk that Japanese investors will start getting rid of the large amounts of euro-denominated assets they still have on their books is rising as the euro homes in on life lows against the yen. These levels would be equivalent to the German mark's weakest levels since August 1997 against the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Such asset sales would risk a wave of repatriation that would exaggerate yen strength and jeopardise Japan's economic recovery, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  They therefore expect any speedy yen gains against the euro to provoke \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , even though the 11-nation euro zone is a less important trading partner than the United States. \par \par \uc2  "As euro/yen continues to move down, the chances of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on euro/yen itself rather than on dollar/yen are rising," said Lee Ferridge, head of global \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy at Rabobank in London. \par \par \uc2  "Japanese investors are long of euro assets and given the size of flows we will see if they begin to bail out, I would not be surprised to see them respond before it is too late." \par \par \uc2  The euro is hovering within striking distance of the 121.15 level which chartists say is the last defence protecting it from yen bulls. \par \par \uc2  Losses below here would be equivalent to the mark's lowest rates against the yen since July 1995, and risk sparking a speedy slide below 120 yen. \par \par \uc2  "A move below 121.20/40, the support base seen in August 1997, and then below 120.50 could see things get nasty as we would then be looking for a move down to 117.50," said Sandeep Bahl, technical analyst at Standard Chartered in London. \par \par \uc2  A break below 121.15 yen would leave the euro nearly four percent below peaks it set on June 18, the last time the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell yen for euros, conducting its sales via the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  While the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sold yen on at least four occasions since then - most recently on July 21 - it has confined its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the dollar/yen exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  But the Japanese authorities have surprised the foreign exchanges by adopting a hands-off policy even on dollar/yen since then, refusing to show their hand despite the dollar's slide to six-month lows near 113.50 yen earlier this month. \par \par \uc2  Some analysts said a change in this policy would depend less on specific chart levels being threatened than on the speed of yen gains. \par \par \uc2  "It will need a sharp move to get the central bankers agitated and they will be more concerned about a vertical drop than the magnitude of the decline," said Avinash Persaud, head of global research at State Street in London. \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will not work in the current environment where investors are short of yen and this is one of the reasons central bankers will only respond to a move down rather than anticipate it." \par \par \uc2  ((London Capital Markets, +44 171 542 6284, swaha.pattanaik@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv8g02hzu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
