\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  MOF Statement Sparks Joint  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\uc2  Fear \b0\par\par\uc2  By Kenneth McCallum \par \uc2 229 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 August 1999\par 09:43\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (Dow Jones)--In a rare move, \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  released a statement Tuesday to announce that top monetary officials in Tokyo and Washington had conferred on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  developments and agreed to continue close contact on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  issues. \par \par \uc2  In a telephone conversation, Japanese Finance Minister Kiichi Miyazawa and U.S. Treasury Secretary Lawrence Summers "exchanged opinions about the U.S. and Japan's respective economies, including trends in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market" and agreed to continue "close exchanges of opinion on these issues," the statement said. \par \par \uc2  The news sparked a brief dollar rally that pushed the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  more than a yen higher to Y115.62, as traders speculated that the two governments were moving closer to joint \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Coming after weeks in which Japanese ministry officials have warned they would take steps to prevent a premature strengthening of the yen, the statement appeared to be an escalation of dollar-supportive rhetoric, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  "It was probably meant to be a form of verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to get the message across to the market that the U.S. and \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  are ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  jointly," said Ryuichi Takami, vice president of the treasury and trading division at Sanwa Bank. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 03-08-99 \par \par \uc2  0743GMT \par \par \uc2  1137 4190 62550 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv8305pce\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
